### Variables

set $mod Mod4

### Output

output * bg #000000 solid_color

### Disable screen blanking

exec swayidle -w timeout 0 ''

### Keyboard

input type:keyboard {
    xkb_layout fr
}

### No mouse cursor after inactivity

seat seat0 hide_cursor 5000

### Floating disabled

floating_modifier none

### No title bars

default_border pixel 0
default_floating_border pixel 0

### Launch camera wall

exec ~/.local/bin/camera-wall.sh

for_window [title="CAM1"] floating enable, resize set 960 540, move position 0 0
for_window [title="CAM2"] floating enable, resize set 960 540, move position 960 0
for_window [title="CAM3"] floating enable, resize set 960 540, move position 0 540
for_window [title="CAM4"] floating enable, resize set 960 540, move position 960 540

### Fullscreen disabled

workspace_layout default

### Emergency terminal

bindsym $mod+Return exec foot

### Reload config

bindsym $mod+Shift+r reload

### Exit sway

bindsym $mod+Shift+e exit